---
<Base {...head}>
<section class="books-index">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Home</a>
  <div class="kicker">The Workshop</div>
  <h2>Apps, <em>by Ink <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Iron Apps</em>.</h2>
  <p class="lede">Small, sharp tools for makers, readers, and small operations. <strong>LibraryIQ</strong> is live as a web app — <a href="https://libraryiq.inknironapps.com" rel="noopener">open it in any browser</a>. MatCalc and Simmer are still in <strong>closed alpha testing</strong> on Android; want to test one? <a href="/contact.html?topic=general">Pick an app on the contact form</a>.</p>

  <article class="app-card">
    <div class="app-card-icon"><img src="/images/apps/libraryiq.png" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="LibraryIQ app icon — reading tracker and library web app"></div>
    <div class="app-card-body">
      <span class="num">Live · Web app</span>
      <h3><a href="/apps/libraryiq.html">LibraryIQ</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Your complete reading tracker — shelf, gallery, tracker, wishlist and book budget in one place.</em></p>
      <p>Live now as a web app at <strong>libraryiq.inknironapps.com</strong> — nothing to install. Scan a barcode in the browser, pull metadata from six catalogues, photograph a whole shelf, and track reading, lending, badges and book spending. Free, syncs to every device, installs to a home screen.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://libraryiq.inknironapps.com" rel="noopener">Open LibraryIQ &rarr;</a>
        <a class="edition-btn ghost" href="/apps/libraryiq.html">Details &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="app-card">
    <div class="app-card-icon"><img src="/images/apps/matcalc.png" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="MatCalc app icon — material calculator for landscapers"></div>
    <div class="app-card-body">
      <span class="num">Alpha · Android</span>
      <h3><a href="/apps/matcalc.html">MatCalc</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Calculate material coverage, conversions, and turf installation needs.</em></p>
      <p>Fast offline calculator for landscapers, contractors, and DIYers. Coverage across 15 shapes, 12 preloaded materials, tonnage and cubic-yard estimates with settling adjustment.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn ghost" href="/apps/matcalc.html">Details &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="app-card">
    <div class="app-card-icon"><img src="/images/apps/simmer.png" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Simmer app icon — local recipe manager"></div>
    <div class="app-card-body">
      <span class="num">Alpha · Android</span>
      <h3><a href="/apps/simmer.html">Simmer</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Collect, modify, and shop from your recipes with AI-powered imports.</em></p>
      <p>Personal recipe manager — no account, no cloud, fully local. Import from URL, photo, or manual entry; AI extraction via your own OpenAI, Gemini, or Claude API key.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn ghost" href="/apps/simmer.html">Details &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
</Base>
